<h3>Purchasing</h3>
<h4><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Responsibilities</span></h4>
<p>The Purchasing Office is responsible for the implementation and administration of the City&rsquo;s purchasing policies and procedures.&nbsp; These procedures include the release of formal bids for a variety of goods and services, as well as&nbsp;obtaining&nbsp;quotes for items not required to go through the formal bidding process.&nbsp; Additionally, the Purchasing Office ensures all purchases of goods and services are made in accordance with state and federal laws, in addition to city ordinances.</p>
<p>More information and additional resources about the Purchasing Office can be found here: <a class="styled-button-calltoaction" href="https://www.cheyennecity.org/Your-Government/Departments/City-Treasurer/Purchasing" target="_self">Go to Purchasing</a></p>
